{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30002_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:501c06e0562cb25a4ec3ea8949a28be610e2dc319ec950700948d258f2fa26e3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d08dd55d57c5ecf0bb4170d8a3b0c9d843fcc86527149778c74f758dd7661b6c",
      "text": "归还的笔记本",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6a5f698982d6f70b4279c304629b1f6e6de6200ed5f132b1a0f2724a43e0e27",
      "text": "为了挖出时间胶囊，S.E.M来到了以前任教的\n学校。道夫在那里发现了一本曾经的学生留下的笔记本。\n为了将那本笔记中书写的故事化为现实，\n三人决定挑战拍摄电视剧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d08dd55d57c5ecf0bb4170d8a3b0c9d843fcc86527149778c74f758dd7661b6c",
      "text": "归还的笔记本",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a5677bb622a8c6358f1366e1c8b394fb039ac527e934c50768c1ad54acdacf",
      "text": "数年前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c25f9998655432b55ad1cb2ea2ee4b779689213e2a22a479dd5b290c396e861c",
      "text": "……喂，你看过这本漫画了吗？\n超级有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67294e8e33a8255b2bb60de74996c2216bc249d627303a11d754429735c504ce",
      "text": "真的假的？那我等下看看。\n反正上课也无聊得很。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2fa41450e26204faeede456e2f88432c864863632c18e6c6972b13fce272214",
      "text": "……你们几位，现在是数学课时间。\n请把与上课无关的东西收起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60825aea7212c457ef00f8a2c9b85697e7466669089cc092df94c7d64233f3b7",
      "text": "（面对学生，教师型机器人硲大声呐喊！\n然而……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0c985f28f58aa52faa19fb5982093a6407f7937ba9e7208604a770f954d7c5",
      "text": "哎——有什么关系嘛。\n新来的老师一边凉快去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfe9a68cf861107fd9c60d1aab7dd346f3226d4e6b0d8d667339457c1ecac7b",
      "text": "（那呐喊声，没能触动任何人的心弦……这样。\n好，这故事写得相当有趣嘛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:012ed3fb5a28385358badedc1ece0deed5a5d04d01fd624e5d492d77e5ec9327",
      "text": "（……果然，今天还是不行吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ada6d6869fa39f83e06636ba44c7558a68a3e18f5d6bc4518cfa79b272e6fb3",
      "text": "（作为教师，我明明只是想把学生们\n引向正确的方向而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ba6bce94585d324fc2f5d887c8adf866c7a7a10c8c30c7e56e0dfd6e4278b7b",
      "text": "（不论我花多少心思，\n我的课堂都引不起他们的兴趣）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f45b24db912158b6d806d8d535975ce72863e7036b27dbd36945d99883cc89",
      "text": "（……但我绝不放弃。\n一定有某种好办法才对）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
